ain library, housing fine arts, humanities, social sciences, science, archives, and government documents.","source_url":"https://libraries.pub.luc.edu/locations","source_title":"Library Locations & Maps | Loyola University Chicago Libraries","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Loyola Archives says entry to Cudahy Library is through the Information Commons; check library hours before visiting.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"luc-damen-student-center","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Damen Student Center","title":"Meet at Damen before an organization program","subtitle":"Lake Shore Campus · 6511 N. Sheridan Rd.","notes":"Use the atrium and meeting areas as a practical rendezvous point, then stop by the Center for Student Engagement for involvement questions.","short_summary":"The student-life hub combines dining, recreation, a cinema, and organization meeting areas.","evidence_claim":"Loyola calls Damen its primary hub for student-life engagement and describes dining, recreation, cinema, and meeting areas there.","source_url":"https://www.luc.edu/undergrad/lifeatloyola/studentlife/","source_title":"Student Life | Loyola University Chicago","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Academic-calendar building hours are published by Damen; some offices and programs have separate hours.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"luc-mundelein-center","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Mundelein Center","title":"Look for a program in Mundelein’s Palm Court or Sky Lounge","subtitle":"Lake Shore Campus · 1020 W. Sheridan Rd.","notes":"Check the campus scheduling system for what is happening in named Mundelein rooms before heading over for a performance or gathering.","short_summary